    "description": "Cvent Events is your place to easily plan out your event experience, find where you need to go next, network with other attendees, and learn more about sponsors and exhibitors.\r\n\r\nIn the app:\r\nView Multiple Events \u2013 Access the different events you\u2019re attending all from a single app\r\nAgenda \u2013 Explore the complete conference schedule, including keynotes, workshops, special sessions, and more\r\nSpeakers \u2013 Learn more about who\u2019s speaking and check out their presentations\r\nSponsors and Exhibitors \u2013 See the event\u2019s sponsors and exhibitors\r\n\r\nWe hope you enjoy the app and the event!",
